21295,"Spamf spam Online Notification of New Legal Notices
If this email is not spam, click here to submit the signatures to Fireguard - AntiSpam Service. If this email is not spam, click here to submit the signatures to Fireguard - AntiSpam Service. Online Notification of New Legal Notices Lloyds TSB online for business - Online Notification of New Legal Notices Dear Customer: Thank you for banking with us at Lloyds TSB. We have new information to share with you about changes to the terms, conditions, or disclosures that apply to your account. That information is now available to view online. We are providing the information online because you agreed and instructed us to send you your account statements, as well as our account-related notices, through online delivery. Here's how to access the new information: 1. Click here to Sign on to Lloyds TSB Online 2. Select quot;Text Alerts&quot; on the left screen 3. Go to quot;Important Documents&quot; section and make your selection For your convenience, you'll be able to view this information online (and print it for future reference) for 6 days from the date of this email. Sincerely, Lloyds TSB Online Business Protect yourself from fraud and identity theft. To learn more, go to Lloyds.co.UK select PRIVACY, Security camp; Legal, and Fraud Information Center. If you have a question about your account, please sign on to your secure online banking session at Lloyds.co.UK. Lloyds TSB Bank plc and Lloyds TSB Scotland plc are authorized and regulated by the Financial Services Authority and signatories to the Banking Codes. FSA authorization can be checked on the FSA&rsquo;s Register at: www.fsa.gov.uk/register. Lloyds TSB Bank plc and Lloyds TSB Scotland plc are members of the Financial Services Compensation Scheme and the Financial Ombudsman Service. Lloyds TSB Group plc.",i01,Information Provision,"GENERAL SETTINGS
