1225,"Unauthorized payment with your Apple ID.
Greetings! We have received a request from your Apple ID for a subscription quot;Skype unlimited world calls plan&quot; at App Store on a computer or gadget that has not before been linked to this account. This purchase was fixed by our newest powered protection service as a risky. In this connection, we have set hold for 7 days for the activation request of the purchasing. After this term, the required amount sum will be debited from your default payment option and the atonement will be put on. If you've made this subscription, please accept our apologies for the inconvenience and just skip this message. If this sign up was made by the mistake, and you want to cancel the subscription, click on the link under the sign-up options in this message, and then change the password on your Apple account, perhaps it was stolen. Sign up options: Subscription name: Skype unlimited Earth calls plan Application name: Skype Company: Microsoft inc. The time of subscription: 5 days Price for the period: 23.99 EUR Subscriber's IP address: 176.212.66.104 (Blood, Russia) Unsubscribe and Manage Subscriptions We remind that your financial reporting data is stored in safety on our servers and nobody can reach it. We will never ask you to give us your profile details, financial data and other personal data by e-mail or telephone. Thanks for using our service. Kind regards The iTunes Store team. Apple Inc. The terms of purchasing subscriptions you can find at the following link: Terms and Conditions Answers to FAQs can be found at the following link: FAQ We have respect for your private life, the information of your data use can be found on the following link: Privacy Policy Copyright 2014 Apple Inc. Please do not reply to this email because we are not monitoring this inbox. To get in touch with us, log in to your account and click quot;Contact Squat; at the bottom of any page. Copyright 2015 Apple Inc. All rights reserved. Email ID:fbhf6995bcae.",i10,Service and Subscription Management,"G