David LoketoDakar Senegalese, I got your contact from the Eco was Information Center in Senegal. My sources of your contact gave me the courage and confidence. It is my pleasure to contact you for a business venture which I intend to establish in your country, though I have not met with you before but I believe one has to risk confiding in success sometimes in life.  I am David Loreto, the son of the former minister for Defense and INTERIOR. There is this huge amount of US$8.8 million (EIGHT MILLION EIGHT HUNDRED THOUSAND US DOLLARS)which my late father kept for us in the security company here in Senegal Dakar before he was poisoned to death by his business associate. Now I have decided to invest this money in your country or anywhere save enough outside Africa for security and political reasons. I want you to help me claim and retrieved these fund from the Fiduciary Fund Holders and Transfer it into your personal account in your country for investment purposes on profitable ventures. If you can be of an assistance to me, I will please to offer you 20% of the total fund. While I have set aside 10% of the total fund for any expenses incur by you during the process. I await your soon response through our private mailbox:David_505@mixmail.com Your house Address........................ Your Phone Number ...................... Your Fax Number ............................ N.B. Upon your interest, I will forward you the security company contact immediately. Respectfully yours, David Loreto.",i10,Service and Subscription Management,"GENERAL SETTINGS
